.TH FGETXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fgetxattr \- reads an extended attribute from an open file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B ssize_t fgetxattr(int descriptor, const char* name, void* value, size_t size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads an extended attribute from an open file. A zero size queries the required length.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fgetxattr (2)
